<file path="api/activity.md">
# Activity API

Existing verified Better Auth bearer session and current health_data_processing consent required for all routes. Summary endpoints and Today additionally require descriptive_summaries. Owner always derives from session; strict body schemas reject owner/source impersonation. Responses use existing private/no-store wrapper.

| Method / path | Contract |
|---|---|
| POST /api/me/activities | Stable UUID create, 201; identical retry returns existing; different payload 409 |
| GET /api/me/activities | date optional local ISO date, cursor optional owned UUID, limit 1–50/default20, archived true/false/defaultfalse |
| GET /api/me/activities/:id | Owned detail, local-time preference and original UTC timestamps |
| PATCH /api/me/activities/:id | expectedVersion+reason and at least one field; transactional revisions; archive/restore via archived boolean |
| GET /api/me/activities/:id/revisions | Prior snapshots/reasons, newest version first |
| GET /api/me/activities/summary | Optional date, otherwise today in saved timezone |
| GET /api/me/activities/weekly | Optional date inside selected week, otherwise user's current week |
| GET /api/me/timeline | domain now accepts activity in addition to all/meal/glucose |
| GET /api/me/summaries/daily | Existing Nutrition top-level contract plus glucose and activity members |
| GET /api/me/today | Activity AVAILABLE with current summary and source-linked preview |

Synthetic create:

```json
{
  "id": "<runtime UUID>",
  "activityType": "walking",
  "startedAt": "<ISO timestamp with offset>",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "distanceKm": null,
  "steps": null,
  "reportedIntensity": "unknown",
  "source": "manual",
  "qualityStatus": "user_reported",
  "notes": null
}
```

Required id/type/start/duration. Types walking/cycling/running/strength/other. Duration integer 1–1440; start is real,>=1900; derived end cannot exceed current server time plus 5-minute clock tolerance. Client endedAt is rejected rather than independently trusted. Optional km 0–1000/three decimals, steps integer 0–1000000; null/omitted is unknown. Intensity unknown/light/moderate/vigorous; manual source only; quality user_reported or needs_review; nullable notes max 2000. These bounds are technical guards, not exercise recommendations.

Detail includes id/type/startedAt/endedAt/durationMinutes, nullable distanceKm/steps, intensity/source/quality/note, version/archive, recordedAt/receivedAt/createdAt/updatedAt, localDate/localTime/endLocalDate/endLocalTime/timezone. Start+30minutes returns end exactly 1800000ms later. Input timezone offsets are preserved semantically as instants, not a separate display-zone field.

PATCH example: `{"expectedVersion":1,"reason":"Correct duration","durationMinutes":45}`. Recalculates end, preserves omitted metrics/source/notes, stores prior state. Archive/restore uses version/reason plus archived true/false; no hard DELETE route. List returns items/details, nextCursorUUID|null and timezone.

Summary returns date/startDate/endDate(exclusive)/timezone/locale/firstDay, count/eligibleCount/reviewCount, durationMinutes|null, distanceKm and steps as `{value,knownSessions,totalSessions,coverage}`, days, activeDays, latest|null, analyticsState, computedAt, freshness CURRENT, coverageStatus RECORDED_ONLY, source manual, attribution START_LOCAL_DATE, durationMethod SUM_REPORTED_SESSIONS and computationVersion activity-reported-v1. Daily firstDay null/days length 1; weekly firstDay 7 for id-ID/days length 7.

Eligible means active user_reported session. No eligible records→durationnull/INSUFFICIENT_DATA, not an assertion of inactivity. One or more→READY. Unknown optional totals staynull; partial totals retain coverage. Start-local-date attribution includes cross-midnight sessions wholly; overlapping sessions are summed independently. Weekly calendar dates use saved locale/timezone, not fixed168-hour windows. Corrections/archive/restore recompute on next read. No calories, inferred goals or medical conclusions.

Errors: 400 invalid strict schema/date/source/numeric/body or invalid opaque timeline cursor; 401 absent/inactive/unverified session; 403 CONSENT_REQUIRED; 404 owned record/cursor missing, including cross-user IDs; 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT/VERSION_CONFLICT; 422 ACTIVITY_NOT_COMPLETED when merged correction would end in future; safe 500 via existing wrapper. Sensitive payloads are not added to logs.

Bruno folder 11 Activity extends the same collection/environment with 20 ordered executable cases. Runtime sessionToken,otherSessionToken,restrictedSessionToken,newActivityId,eventTime; other owner has full consent, restricted health only. Full collection additionally needs newMealId/newGlucoseId. Run `bru run --env test` from collection root in Docker network beokay-test_default with runtime --env-var injection. Use fresh UUIDs/accounts for ordered version 1→4 cases, and eventTime at least 60 minutes before execution. No tracked credentials. Actual results are recorded in [testing](../testing/activity.md).
</file>

<file path="api/endpoint-reference.md">
# Referensi Endpoint API

> Daftar lengkap rute yang terdaftar di `server/src/server.ts` (sumber: `*.routes.ts` tiap modul), diaudit 10 November 2026. Total: **±120 kombinasi metode+path** (+ sub-rute `/api/auth/*` milik Better Auth). Dokumen `docs/api/{activity,glucose,nutrition}.md` lama merinci contoh payload tiga domain pertama; dokumen ini mencakup semuanya.
> Sebagian besar kontrak payload didefinisikan oleh skema Zod di `server/src/features/<modul>/*.schema.ts` — itulah rujukan nama dan batas bidang yang tepat.

## 1. Konvensi umum

| Hal | Aturan |
|---|---|
| Basis URL | dev `http://127.0.0.1:3000` (`API_HOST_PORT`); prod di balik reverse proxy HTTPS |
| Autentikasi | `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Token = header respons `set-auth-token` pada sign-in. Semua `/api/me/*` dan `/api/foods/*` mensyaratkan sesi **dan email terverifikasi** (`401 UNAUTHENTICATED`) |
| Badan | JSON `application/json` (maks 64 KB), skema `.strict()` → bidang tak dikenal ditolak `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`. Pengecualian: `scan/*` menerima byte gambar mentah (maks 1,5 MB) |
| Galat | `{"error":{"code","message","requestId","details?"}}`; header `X-Request-Id` selalu ada |
| Kursor | `?cursor=<uuid>&limit=1..50` (default 20); respons `{items, nextCursor}`. `timeline` memakai kursor `base64url` |
| Filter | `?date=YYYY-MM-DD` (tanggal lokal menurut zona pengguna), `?archived=true|false` |
| Idempotensi | `POST` pencatatan menerima `id` UUID dari klien; isi sama → baris lama, isi beda → `409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT` |
| Koreksi | `PATCH` wajib `expectedVersion` + `reason` (kecuali tabel yang disebut); `409 VERSION_CONFLICT` bila versi berubah |
| Status | `201` untuk pembuatan, `200` untuk lainnya; `202` untuk `ml/warmup` dan `agent/runs?async=1`; `429` untuk rate limit |

Kolom **Consent**: `H` = `health_data_processing`, `S` = `descriptive_summaries`, `A` = `personalized_ai`, `—` = tidak ada. Tanpa consent yang dibutuhkan → `403 CONSENT_REQUIRED` `{details:{purpose}}`.

## 2. Publik

| Metode | Path | Keterangan |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/health` | `{status:"ok"|"degraded", db}`; `503` bila DB tak terjangkau |
| GET | `/api/consent-policies/current` | kebijakan consent aktif (versi, tujuan, dampak penarikan) |
| GET | `/auth/verified` | halaman HTML hasil verifikasi email |
| GET | `/auth/reset-password?token=` | halaman HTML formulir reset sandi |

## 3. Autentikasi — `/api/auth/*` (Better Auth)

Dikelola pustaka; rute yang dipakai aplikasi (terverifikasi dari `auth_repository.dart`):

| Metode | Path | Catatan |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/auth/sign-up/email` | tidak masuk otomatis; mengirim email verifikasi |
| POST | `/api/auth/sign-in/email` | menolak bila email belum terverifikasi; kembalikan token di `set-auth-token` |
| GET | `/api/auth/get-session` | |
| POST | `/api/auth/sign-out` | |
| POST | `/api/auth/send-verification-email` | |
| POST | `/api/auth/request-password-reset` | |
| POST | `/api/auth/reset-password` | token berlaku 1 jam; mencabut semua sesi |
| POST | `/api/auth/change-password` | |
| GET | `/api/auth/list-sessions` · POST `/api/auth/revoke-other-sessions` | |

Rate limit (per menit): umum 120; `sign-in/email` 5; `sign-up/email` 5; `request-password-reset` 3; `reset-password` 5; `send-verification-email` 3; `change-password` 5. Origin harus ada di `TRUSTED_ORIGINS` (atau `BETTER_AUTH_URL`) untuk permintaan berbasis browser; klien mobile tanpa header `Origin`.

## 4. Identitas, consent, onboarding

| Metode | Path | Consent | Keterangan |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET · PATCH | `/api/me/profile` | — | `displayName`, `birthYear` |
| GET · PUT · PATCH | `/api/me/health-profile` | — | `PUT` penuh, `PATCH` parsial; menghitung ulang `eligibilityStatus` |
| GET · PATCH | `/api/me/preferences` | — | `locale`, `timezone`, `glucoseUnit`, `textSize`, `reduceMotion` |
| GET | `/api/me/consents` | — | status per tujuan + riwayat |
| POST | `/api/me/consents` | — | `{policyVersion, purposes[], source}` |
| POST | `/api/me/consents/withdraw` | — | `{purposes[]}` |
| GET · PATCH | `/api/me/onboarding` | — | state diturunkan; `PATCH {introSeen:true, expectedVersion?}` |
| POST | `/api/me/onboarding/complete` | — | `409 ONBOARDING_INCOMPLETE {missingSteps}` bila belum lengkap |
| GET | `/api/me/export` | — (sengaja) | ekspor data milik sendiri, 5/jam |

## 5. Pencatatan

Semua baris berikut: **Consent H** (ringkasan juga **S**).

| Domain | Metode + Path |
|---|---|
| Makanan (katalog) | GET `/api/foods/search?q=` · POST `/api/me/foods` · PATCH `/api/me/foods/:id` |
| Makan | GET, POST `/api/me/meals` · GET, PATCH `/api/me/meals/:id` · GET `/api/me/meals/:id/revisions` |
| Glukosa | GET, POST `/api/me/glucose` · GET `/api/me/glucose/summary` (**S**) · GET, PATCH `/api/me/glucose/:id` · GET `…/:id/revisions` |
| Aktivitas | GET, POST `/api/me/activities` · POST `/api/me/activities/import` · GET `/api/me/activities/summary` (**S**) · GET `/api/me/activities/weekly` (**S**) · GET, PATCH `/api/me/activities/:id` · GET `…/:id/revisions` |
| Obat | GET, POST `/api/me/medications` · GET `/api/me/medications/today` · GET, PATCH `/api/me/medications/:id` · GET `…/:id/revisions` · GET, POST `…/:id/schedules` · PATCH `…/:id/schedules/:scheduleId` · GET, POST `…/:id/intakes` · GET, PATCH `…/:id/intakes/:intakeId` |
| Tujuan | GET, POST `/api/me/goals` · GET, PATCH `/api/me/goals/:id` · GET, POST `…/:id/checkins` · PATCH `…/:id/checkins/:checkinId` |
| Timeline | GET `/api/me/timeline?domain=all|meal|glucose|activity|medication|goal&date=&cursor=&limit=&archived=` |
| Preferensi makanan | GET, POST `/api/me/food-preferences` · POST `…/check` · PATCH `…/:id` |
| Pengingat | GET, POST `/api/me/reminders` · GET `…/upcoming?days=1..14` · PATCH `…/:id` |
| Sinkronisasi | POST `/api/me/sync/operations` (1–50 operasi) · GET `/api/me/sync/status` |

Catatan khusus:
- `GET /api/me/medications/today` mengembalikan kemunculan jadwal; yang belum dikonfirmasi berstatus `unknown`.
- `POST /api/me/activities/import` `{source: "health_connect"|"apple_health", sessions[1..100]}` → hasil per sesi `CREATED | CREATED_NEEDS_REVIEW | DUPLICATE | REJECTED`.
- `POST /api/me/sync/operations` → `{items:[{operationId, status: SYNCED|CONFLICT|NEEDS_REVIEW|SYNC_FAILED, recordId, result?, error?}]}`; `403 CONSENT_REQUIRED` untuk seluruh permintaan bila consent H ditarik.

## 6. Ringkasan dan insight (Consent H + S)

